    "body": "I don't think that's great, because now the definition only applies to input elements. The \"default value\" concept does somewhat exist; the spec says\r\n\r\n> The contents of the control represent the control's default value.\r\n\r\nfor textarea and\r\n\r\n> The value content attribute gives the default value of the input element.\r\n\r\nfor input.",
